# Special meter full (set for the test): Right, Down then J in the air is a Kickflip Superman.
park lab
spawn lab_ledge
cmd 0 set skater.special 1
hold up 0..60
hold ollie 60..90
tap right 92
tap down 96
tap flip 98
run 320
expect event trickStart{trick=Kickflip Superman} within 97..100
expect event comboLanded{name=Kickflip Superman} within 200..240
expect no event bail
